{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05556","headline":"和户部杨员外伯成寓直 · 李憕","name":"和户部杨员外伯成寓直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落日弥纶地，公才画省郎。\n词惊起草笔，坐引护衣香。\n双阙天河近，千门夕漏长。\n遥知台上宿，不独有文强。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李憕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗品彚（附唐诗拾遗）》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩品彚_(四庫全書本)）"}